TITLE:: LinkBPM
summary:: Gets and sets the BPM of the Link clock of the server
categories:: UGens>Clock, Streams-Patterns-Events
related:: Classes/LinkPhase, Classes/LinkClock, Classes/LinkJump

DESCRIPTION::

Allows to get and set the BPM of the servers Link clock, such that the BPM can be modulated through a signal.
See LINK::Classes/LinkPhase:: for examples.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: kr
Returns the current BPM of the Link clock of the server.
If the server clock has not been enabled via LINK::LinkPhase#*start::, it will return MATH::-1.0::.
argument:: change
If this value is MATH::>0.0::, the BPM (second argument) will be used to set for the Link clock and published to the other clients.
argument:: bpm
The BPM to be set.
Ableton Link only allows values between MATH::[20, 999]::.

NOTE::
See also LINK::Classes/LinkPhase#*setBPM::
::
